# S013681 candidate summary

Added `src/include/linux/decompress/unlzma.rs` with immutable provenance and
the sole `unlzma` C-ABI declaration from the pinned header.

- C `unsigned char *` parameters map to `*mut c_uchar`.
- C `long` and `unsigned long` map to `c_long` and `c_ulong`.
- C nullable `fill` and `flush` function pointers map to `Option<unsafe extern
  "C" fn(*mut c_void, c_ulong) -> c_long>`.
- C `char *` callback input maps to `*mut c_char`; `error` is non-null because
  the pinned implementation calls it without a null check.
